Quantitative literacy sources — books, standards, and articles (@ql-sources: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @quantitative-literacy) { r_7MMXWNA1B4YGA271KMHPPJEK9Q
The reading spine uses complete technical-mathematics books, then drawing, unit, measurement, and modelling references. Each source Record identifies author, edition, language, assigned scope, authorized access, and known reuse terms. English readings are complemented by Portuguese SI and metrology vocabulary.

