All books and papers remain external references. Use the publisher's authorized downloads for a personally retained copy. The learning explanations, original worked examples, and links are the content developed here.

Publisher pages and source metadata were checked on 28 October 2026. The Blueprint host intermittently blocks automated access; its source Record states the inspected scope. Current web notices and older distributed editions can differ, especially for OpenStax. Preserve the actual edition's notice when retaining or reusing a work; do not infer an unrestricted licence from free access.

